<title>NETHERLANDS: Wegener to acquire Spanish record firm.</title>
<headline>Wegener to acquire Spanish record firm.</headline>
<dateline>APELDOORN, Netherlands 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch publisher Wegener NV said its Arcade Entertainment subsidiary will acquire Spanish recorded music company Divulgacion de Cassettes SA.  </p>
<p>Wegener said Divulgacion was market leader in the the field of traditional Spanish music like &quot;copla&quot; and &quot;flamengo&quot;.</p>
<p>The Spanish firm employs 48 staff and turnover was over 17 million guilders in 1995. Wegener said Divilgacion was profitable.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
